      "x": 690, "y": 290,
      "width": 470, "height": 140,
      "text": "SSE reader task          \u2502  subscriber queues (fan-out)\nreplay buffer (deque)    \u2502  turn generation counter\nagent_busy / shutdown     \u2502  last_activity / turn_completed_at\nSandboxAgentClient       \u2502  last_event_id (SSE cursor)\nerrors (deque, max 100)  \u2502  session_log (Postgres)\nnew_turn() \u2192 resume_buffering() \u2192 subscribe() \u2192 broadcast()",
